      \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/120ed17ccca7ff235cff960a92d4e0d0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuoooo\" data-uid=\"529572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuoooo\">yuoooo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 09:59:35 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Apple 新账号直接充值礼品卡消费会被 Apple 限制，找人工客服申诉一下就行了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117772\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7c1dd47ad34e8714b2494d54cd2304ad?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"young1\" data-uid=\"624101\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/young1\">young1</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:02:48 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yuoooo\">yuoooo</a>  这个在哪里找哇。我在这个 APP 支持里面看到技术支持，但是我点击进去就说所在地区没有可用的技术支持</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117964\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fe70b1944c314ecc28d550761cfab24b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"oom\" data-uid=\"641849\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/oom\">oom</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:24:02 +08:00\">19h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/noahliaszn\">noahliaszn</a> #8 很玄学，土耳其的 apple id 用了几年了，上周注册了 claude ，准备养一个月再订阅，结果三天后被封了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117998\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f7b4/469d/469348_normal.png?m=1581758320\" alt=\"gibber\" data-uid=\"469348\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gibber\">gibber</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:28:12 +08:00\">19h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这是苹果的机制，购买礼品卡马上消费会被风控，需要等 72 小时以上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18117999\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7c87/5619/91214_normal.png?m=1421333682\" alt=\"starlin\" data-uid=\"91214\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/starlin\">starlin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:28:15 +08:00\">19h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 封的没有道理可讲</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18118148\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/bcf7/c339/349404_normal.png?m=1789469162\" alt=\"whcss\" data-uid=\"349404\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whcss\">whcss</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:45:54 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>之前用老的 Apple ID 订阅了 1 个月的 claude ，早上开通，傍晚就被 hold 了。后来在 Apple 申请退款，通过了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18118150\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3e74c2fe0362c231bc7a6e528296151a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhya\" data-uid=\"291599\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhya\">zhya</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:46:25 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我 claude 一直用的挺好，前两天心血来潮让他做了一下上海今年高考数学题。然后第二天就被封了。<br>PS：claude 只做了填空和选择，全对。GPT 做了整套，错了道选择题，大题我也没仔细对比过程，结果都对。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18118262\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7263/ca1c/380287_normal.png?m=1778487611\" alt=\"TataJiang\" data-uid=\"380287\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/TataJiang\">TataJiang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 10:59:57 +08:00\">19h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我猜测用不了一周，你就会问 Antropic 封号后如何申请退款。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18118386\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fa70/42da/194163_normal.png?m=1749184790\" alt=\"potatowish\" data-uid=\"194163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/potatowish\">potatowish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 11:16:04 +08:00\">19h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>和 Anthropic 没关系，这是 apple 对新账号的风控，你有这时间发帖，去问下 chatgpt 就知道了，我有一个英国 appid 充值购买会弹出这个需要提示框，反馈后过几天就会发邮件给你</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18119002\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9eb5/fe10/265488_normal.png?m=1730787716\" alt=\"Rinndy\" data-uid=\"265488\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rinndy\">Rinndy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 13:40:38 +08:00\">16h 42m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>建议提前看好退款申诉流程</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18119009\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a326/0df4/477906_normal.png?m=1787193962\" alt=\"lgc931018\" data-uid=\"477906\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lgc931018\">lgc931018</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 13:41:25 +08:00\">16h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>新号有时候会触发审核 3 天就可以了 最好是 3 天中不用操作 我做了个礼品卡充值视频 评论者就有部分就是这样的问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120224\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a7e3/031a/759637_normal.png?m=1753761405\" alt=\"mochu8\" data-uid=\"759637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mochu8\">mochu8</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 16:39:52 +08:00\">13h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>坐等 KYC 然后封号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120449\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ac17441e5ef513d4904aab6e134dc400?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jiebozhang\" data-uid=\"49501\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jiebozhang\">jiebozhang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-23 17:13:14 +08:00\">13h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>从 2023-8 开始用 Claude ，没敢充值怕被封号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18120619\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/65cb/3dad/821929_normal.png?m=1781369112\" alt=\"robinxplorer\" data-uid=\"821929\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n